            {
              "text": "Bwana",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "NUM.32.22",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "NUM.32.22"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Lakini mkishindwa kufanya hili, mtakuwa mnatenda dhambi dhidi ya",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Bwana",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "NUM.32.23",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "NUM.32.23"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "; nanyi kuweni na hakika kuwa dhambi yenu itawapata.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jengeni miji kwa ajili ya wanawake na watoto wenu, na mazizi kwa ajili ya mbuzi na kondoo zenu, lakini fanyeni yale mliyoahidi.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wagadi na Wareubeni wakamwambia Mose, \"Sisi watumishi wako tutafanya kama bwana wetu anavyotuagiza.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Watoto na wake zetu, makundi ya mbuzi na kondoo, na makundi ya ngʼombe zetu, watabaki hapa katika miji ya Gileadi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lakini watumishi wenu, kila mwanaume aliyevaa silaha za vita, watavuka ngʼambo kupigana mbele za",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Bwana",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "NUM.32.27",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "NUM.32.27"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", sawa kama bwana wetu anavyosema.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kisha Mose akatoa amri kuhusu wao kwa kuhani Eleazari, na Yoshua mwana wa Nuni na viongozi wa jamaa za makabila ya Waisraeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mose akawaambia, \"Ikiwa Wagadi na Wareubeni, kila mwanaume aliyevaa silaha za vita, atavuka Yordani pamoja nanyi mbele za",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Bwana",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "NUM.32.29",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "NUM.32.29"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", basi wakati mtakapoishinda nchi iliyoko mbele yenu, wapeni nchi ya Gileadi kama milki yao.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lakini kama hawatavuka pamoja nanyi wakiwa wamevaa silaha za vita, lazima wakubali kupokea milki yao pamoja nanyi katika nchi ya Kanaani.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wagadi na Wareubeni wakajibu, \"Watumishi wako watafanya lile",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Bwana",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "NUM.32.31",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "NUM.32.31"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "alilosema.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tutavuka mbele za",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Bwana",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "NUM.32.32",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "NUM.32.32"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kuingia Kanaani tukiwa tumevaa silaha za vita, lakini mali tutakayoirithi itakuwa ngʼambo hii ya Yordani.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.32"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kisha Mose akawapa Wagadi, Wareubeni, na nusu ya kabila la Manase mwana wa Yosefu ufalme wa Sihoni mfalme wa Waamori, na ufalme wa Ogu mfalme wa Bashani, nchi yote pamoja na miji yake, na nchi inayowazunguka.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.33"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wagadi wakajenga Diboni, Atarothi, Aroeri,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atroth-Shofani, Yazeri, Yogbeha,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Beth-Nimra na Beth-Harani kama miji iliyozungushiwa ngome, tena wakajenga mazizi kwa ajili ya makundi yao ya mbuzi na kondoo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nao Wareubeni wakajenga upya miji ya Heshboni, Eleale na Kiriathaimu,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "pia Nebo na Baal-Meoni (majina ya hiyo miji yalibadilishwa) na Sibma. Miji waliyoijenga upya waliipa majina.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.38"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wazao wa Makiri mwana wa Manase walikwenda Gileadi, wakaiteka nchi na kuwafukuza Waamori waliokuwa huko.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwa hiyo Mose akawapa Wamakiri, wazao wa Manase, nchi ya Gileadi, nao wakakaa huko.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yairi, mzao wa Manase, akateka makao yao, akayaita Hawoth-Yairi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye Noba akateka Kenathi na makao yaliyoizunguka, akayaita Noba kwa jina lake.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.42"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
